{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1SA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"撒母耳記上","commonName":"撒母耳記上","title":"撒母耳記上","order":9,"numberOfChapters":31,"sha256":"afd4c42264886886f4c93c9ded2df28672b888cd7589c48c86c727c240db89d3","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1SA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":31,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1SA/31.json","totalNumberOfVerses":809},"chapter":{"number":31,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["掃羅和他兒子的死"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["非利士人與以色列人爭戰。以色列人在非利士人面前逃跑，在基利波有被殺仆倒的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["非利士人緊追掃羅和他兒子們，就殺了掃羅的兒子約拿單、亞比拿達、麥基舒亞。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["勢派甚大，掃羅被弓箭手追上，射傷甚重，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["就吩咐拿他兵器的人說：「你拔出刀來，將我刺死，免得那些未受割禮的人來刺我，凌辱我。」但拿兵器的人甚懼怕，不肯刺他；掃羅就自己伏在刀上死了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["拿兵器的人見掃羅已死，也伏在刀上死了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["這樣，掃羅和他三個兒子，與拿他兵器的人，以及跟隨他的人，都一同死亡。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["住平原那邊並約旦河西的以色列人，見以色列軍兵逃跑，掃羅和他兒子都死了，也就棄城逃跑。非利士人便來住在其中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["次日，非利士人來剝那被殺之人的衣服，看見掃羅和他三個兒子仆倒在基利波山，"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["就割下他的首級，剝了他的軍裝，打發人到",{"noteId":7},"非利士地的四境，報信與他們廟裏的偶像和眾民；"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["又將掃羅的軍裝放在亞斯她錄廟裏，將他的屍身釘在伯‧珊的城牆上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["基列‧雅比的居民聽見非利士人向掃羅所行的事，"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["他們中間所有的勇士就起身，走了一夜，將掃羅和他兒子的屍身從伯‧珊城牆上取下來，送到雅比那裏，用火燒了；"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["將他們骸骨葬在雅比的垂絲柳樹下，就禁食七日。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":7,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：送到","reference":{"chapter":31,"verse":9}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1SA/31.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2SA/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1SA/30.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}